          "text": "ADVANCED PART\r\nIn order to work with multi-channel field, each part need to be assigned\r\nto a specific field. To do this, it is necessary to use a AdvancedPart\r\ncomponent, which provides more inputs to specify Part parameters.\r\nThe FIELD input of the AdvancedPart component is set to the name\r\nof the desired field.",
